// Campaign version 2 (docs/foundation/21-campaign-v2.md): the 60 live fixtures, built to RULEBOOK.md version 2.
//
//   fixtures 1-4    the gentle opening four, kept exactly as they were (tuned for newcomers; not regenerated)
//   fixtures 5-60   seven seasons of eight (the story's seasons 2-8). Eight of them are the owner's favourite hand-built
//                   levels (FAVS below), adapted to the current engine; the other 48 are generated by tools/gen
//
// The ramp is rulebook 7.3 cut into the story's seasons of eight (campaign.js slot() uses seasons of sixteen):
//   even seasons (2, 4, 6, 8): positions 1-6 standard, 7 hard, 8 the season's closing level (8-15 takes)
//   odd seasons  (3, 5, 7):    positions 1-3 hard, 4 standard (the breather, every fourth level), 5-7 hard, 8 closing
//   two seasons make one repeat of the 5-20 pattern: repeat r = 0 (fixtures 5-20), 1 (21-36), 2 (37-52), 3 (53-60);
//   each repeat raises the speed band 0.1 m/s and takes 0.3 s off the slack band (generate.js bandFor)
//   engine: fixtures 5-8 B only and no marker hand-over, 9 on A+B (the ramp rule of 2.8)
//
//   node tools/gen/campaign-v2.js plan                              print the 60 slots
//   node tools/gen/campaign-v2.js gen --from 5 --to 32 --out F.json generate the plan's generated slots in order
//   node tools/gen/campaign-v2.js favs --out F.json                 adapt the favourites: clock fitted, final checks
//   node tools/gen/campaign-v2.js write A.json B.json ...           write packs 2-8 and tools/scripts/pack2-8.js
// Same seeds, same levels.
